# PR Workflow

1. Review all changes with `git diff`
{{#if parameters.runTestsFirst}}
2. Run tests and lint before creating PR
{{/if}}
3. Create a descriptive branch name
4. Write PR title and body with summary and test plan
5. Push branch and create PR with `gh pr create`
{{#if parameters.smallPrs}}
- Keep PRs focused; split large changes into reviewable chunks
{{/if}}
